<title>GEORGIA: TENNIS-GEORGIA AND SLOVENIA LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GEORGIA AND SLOVENIA LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia and Slovenia were level</p>
<p>1-1 in their Davis Cup tennis Euro/African zone group two first</p>
<p>round tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Istoc Bozic (Slovenia) beat Vladimir Margalitadze (Georgia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Vladimir Gabrichidze (Georgia) beat Borut Urch (Slovenia) 6-3</p>
<p>7-5 1-6 3-6 6-4</p>
</text>
